    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "cutting",
      "twice",
      "this year"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_A",
    "text": "What drove this shift? Was it the\ndata?",
    "start": 23.035,
    "end": 25.031,
    "voice_id": "XZEfcFyBnzsNJrdvkWdI",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "shift",
      "data"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_B",
    "text": "Exactly. The report points to a\ntrifecta: growth remains robust,\nlabor markets are stabilizing, and\nprice pressures are building",
    "start": 25.391,
    "end": 29.153,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "trifecta",
      "growth",
      "robust"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 2
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_B",
    "text": "again.",
    "start": 29.153,
    "end": 32.915,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "trifecta",
      "growth",
      "robust"
    ],
    "page_index": 2,
    "page_count": 2
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_B",
    "text": "That’s a hawkish backdrop.",
    "start": 33.275,
    "end": 34.714,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "hawkish backdrop"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_A",
    "text": "But earlier, there was talk of\neasing bias. What happened to\nthat?",
